ping I get  even more items that we can use in this  wonderful space at this point I'm just  hoping Nintendo will add even more  themed Park items to the game such as a  ferris wheel or even a roller coaster  would be amazing if it happens but I'm  not holding the breath well if you've  gotten any new ideas at all from this  video be sure and hit the thumbs up  before you go and if you want to see  more videos like this in general then  hit that subscribe button so you won't  miss any of our future videos and I'll  know just how many of you out there  really want to see more that's gonna be  it for me today if you're ready to take  your own trip to retro land and visit  retro raconteur dot-com today that's  retro raconteur dot-com

